              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andenyi ya Israeli yose ndekorekoghe na mndungi ughokie sa Absalomu. Odeghoka kufuma maghunyi kwake hata chongonyi; mundu usewadie itiko jingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngelo edumbua iridia jake (angu orekoghe ukijidumbua kula kutua kwa mwaka angu jeremlemeriagha) jerekoghe na wulemeri ghwa kilo iwi na kuchumba kunughana na vipimo va agho matuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Absalomu orevailoghe wana wa womi wadadu, na mwai umweri uwangwaghwa Tamari; nao orekoghe mwana wa waka ughokie nandighi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Absalomu ukakaia Jerusalemu miaka iwi usemmbonie mzuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Absalomu ukamdumiria Joabu uchemghenja kwa mzuri, ela Joabu ukalegha. Ukaduma sena indo ja kawi, ela Joabu ukalegha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Absalomu ukawizera wadumiki wake, “Nechi mbuwa ya Joabu eeka kaavui na yapo; nao oko na shairi, idana ghendenyi muikore.” Niko wadumiki wa Absalomu wikaikora ija mbuwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Joabu ukawuka ukaghenda kwa Absalomu nyumbenyi kwake, ukamzera, “Kwaki wadumiki wako wakora mbuwa yapo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Absalomu ukatumbulia, “Ni angu nerekudumirieghe momu kuche kwapo kukalegha. Neekunda kuendemkotia mzuri sababu ya ini kucha kufuma Geshuri? Si baa nerekaiagha ahoeni? Idana nighenje kwa mzuri nimmbone; na ukawona wuwiwi ghungi kwapo unibwaghe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Joabu ukaghenda ukamghoria mzuri, na mzuri ukammbanga Absalomu. Niko Absalomu ukacha kwa mzuri ukaghoghoma na kudunga wushu ghwake andonyi imbiri kwake; mzuri ukamsusugha Absalomu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
